  <para style="h">1 Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Akpa Ñwed Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Te</para>
  <para style="mt1">Akpa Ñwed Tesalonika</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Ñwed emi oto Pọl, Sailas, ye Timoti. Enọ esọk ufọk Abasi ke Tesalonika, emi edide inyene Abasi Ete ye Ọbọñ Jisọs Kraist. Yak mfọn ye emem Abasi odu ye mbufo.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Ñnyin inọnọ Abasi ekọm kpukpru ini ibaña mbufo kpukpru, inyuñ iti ibaña mbufo ke mme akam ñnyin. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />Ñnyin iti ke iso Abasi ye Ete, nte mbufo edade mbuọtidem mbufo esin ke edinam, nte ima mbufo anamde mbufo esin ifik ke ọkpọsọñ utom, ye nte idorenyin mbufo ke Ọbọñ ñnyin Jisọs Kraist ọsọñọde ada. Utibe Mbuọtidem Mmọ<verse eid="1TH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Ñnyin imọdiọñọ mme nditọ Ete, ite ke Abasi ama mbufo, onyuñ emek mbufo ndidi Esie. <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />Koro ñnyin ikada Eti mbuk emi isọk mbufo, ikedighe ke ikọ inua ikpọñ ikpọñ, edi ekedi ñko ye odudu ye Edisana Spirit, ye ntọtuñọ edituk emi akpanikọ okotukde esit mbufo. Mbufo emefiọk nte ñnyin ikodude uwem ke ini emi ikodude ye mbufo, ekedi ke ufọn mbufo. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Mbufo ema ekpebe ñnyin ye Ọbọñ Jisọs, ndien okposuk edi emi mbufo ekekutde ukut eti eti, mbufo ema ebọ Eti Etop emi ke idara, emi otode Edisana Spirit.<verse eid="1TH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Ke ntre, mbufo ema ekabade edi uwutñkpọ enọ kpukpru mme andinim ke akpanikọ emi edude ke Masidonia ye Kris. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Koro etop emi abañade Ọbọñ Jisọs, ọkọwọrọ ke otu mbufo, ikikaha ibine mbon Masidonia ye Kris ikpọñ, mbuọtidem mbufo ke Abasi ama asuana osim kpukpru ebiet. Ñkpọ efen ndomokiet isuhọke aba emi ñnyin ikpetiñde. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Kpukpru mme owo oro etiñ ebaña nte mbufo ekedarade ñnyin ke ini emi ñnyin ikedide ndise mbufo, ye nte mbufo ekpade edem enọ mme edibot ñkpri abasi, etiene Abasi, ndinam ñkpọ nnọ Ndodu ye Ata Abasi. <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />Ye ndibet mbeñe Eyen Esie ndito enyọñ, kpa Eyen Esie Jisọs emi Enye ekemenerede ke ñkpa, ndien Enye afak ñnyin osio ke iyaresit Abasi emi edidide.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Mbufo nditọ ete, emediọñọ ke idem mbufo ete, edidi emi ñnyin ikedide ndise mbufo ikedighe ikpuikpu. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Mbufo emefiọk nte mbon Filipai eketimerede, enyuñ esuñi ñnyin, mbemiso ñnyin ikedi ibine mbufo ke Tesalonika. Tutu ye oro Abasi ñnyin ama ọnọ ñnyin isọñesit ye ukeme nditiñ Eti Etop emi nnọ mbufo emi etode Enye, okposuk edi emi ubiọñọ okokponde eti eti. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Ebeñe emi ñnyin inamde inọ mbufo itoho ke ndudue, mme ke idiọk ekikere, mme ñnyin ndiñwana ndinam ñkari ye owo ndomokiet.<verse eid="1TH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />Ñnyin ikam itiñ ikọ kpukpru ini nte Abasi oyomde ñnyin itiñ, koro Enye ama enyime ñnyin, onyuñ ayak Eti Mbuk emi esin ñnyin ke ubọk. Ñnyin iñwanake ndinem owo esit, edi iñwana ndinem Abasi esit, emi odomode uduak esit ñnyin ese.<verse eid="1TH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Isuñ Emi Etode Abasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Mbufo emetim efiọk ete ke ñnyin ikedighe itiene mbufo ye nneminua, mme ndida mme ikọ mfuk idiọk itọñ ñnyin, Abasi edi ntiense ñnyin. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Ñnyin ikeñwanake ndibọ itoro nto owo baba kiet, mme otode mbufo mme mme mmọ efen. <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />Okposuk edi emi ñnyin ikenyenede unen nte mme Isuñutom Kraist ndibup mbufo ñkpọ ekededi. Edi ñnyin ikodu ifure ifure uwem ke ini emi ikodude ye mbufo, ukem ukem nte eka nditọ ekpemede nditọ esie. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Ke ntak ima emi ñnyin inyenede inọ mbufo, ñnyin ima ibeñe idem ndibuana ye mbufo, idighe Eti Mbuk emi otode Abasi ikpọñ edi uwem ñnyin nde. Mbufo ema eduk ñnyin esit eti eti.<verse eid="1TH 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Eneni iduhọ, mbufo emeti nditọ ete, nte ñnyin ikanamde utom inyuñ ibọ ufen! Ñnyin ikanam utom okoneyo ye uwemeyo, man ñnyin ididi ubiọñọ inọ mbufo kadaña emi ñnyin ikọkwọrọde Eti Mbuk emi otode Abasi inọ mbufo. <verse eid="1TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Mbufo edi mme ntiense ñnyin, ntre ñko ke Abasi edi. Edinam ñnyin ye mbufo emi enimde ke akpanikọ ekedi edisana, nnen nnen, ikonyuñ inyeneke ndo. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Mbufo emefiọk ete ke ñnyin ikanam ñkpọ ye mbufo kiet kiet kpa nte ete nditọ anamde ñkpọ ye nditọ esie. <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />Ñnyin ima idọñ mbufo esit, ima isọñọ mbufo idem, ima inyuñ ika iso ndinyik mbufo ndidu uduot uwem emi enemde Abasi esit, Enye emi okokotde mbufo edibuana ke Obio Ubọñ ye ubọñ Esie.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Ndien ke mme ntak eken ñko, ñnyin inọnọ Abasi ekọm kpukpru ini. Ke ini emi ñnyin ikadade Etop Abasi isọk mbufo, mbufo ema ekop enyuñ enyime ndibọ enye. Idighe nte etop owo, edi nte etop emi otode Abasi emi ke akpanikọ edide ntre. Koro Abasi akanam utom ke otu mbufo emi enimde ke akpanikọ.<verse eid="1TH 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Mbufo nditọ ete mi, ukem se iketibede ye ufọk Abasi ke Judia ye ikọt Abasi emi ekedude do emi ekedide inyene Kraist, ama etibe ukem ukem ye mbufo. Mbufo ema ekut ukem ukọbọ ke ubọk mbon obio mbufo, nte emi mmọ ekekutde ke ubọk mme Ju, <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />emi ekewotde Ọbọñ Jisọs Kraist, ye mme asiak uduak Abasi, enyuñ ekọbọ ñnyin. Mmọ ikenemke Abasi esit, enyuñ eduọ obom ye kpukpru owo. <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />Mmọ ema eñwana nditre ñnyin ndikwọrọ ikọ nnọ mme mmọ emi midighe mme Ju, kpa Eti Mbuk emi edidade ubọhọ isọk mmọ. Emi edi akpatre uyọhọ udomo idiọkñkpọ emi mmọ ekenamde kpukpru ini. Ndien ke emi, iyaresit Abasi ama ọduọ ofuk mmọ ke utit.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Edi ama edi ñnyin nditọ ete, kadaña emi ñnyin ikadianarede ye mbufo ke esisit ini, ke ikpọkidem idighe ke ekikere, ima ikpu mbufo eti eti, inyuñ iñwana nditọñọ ntak ndi — ndikut mbufo. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Ñnyin ima iyom ndifiak edem mbine mbufo. Ami Pọl mma ñwana ndifiak ndi, ndibe ini kiet, edi andidiọk ikayakke ñnyin idi. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Ke editim ntiñ, edi mbufo, kpa mbufo, idighe mme mmọ efen, edi idorenyin ñnyin, inemesit ñnyin, ye ntak edibure mbufo edikan ke iso Ọbọñ ñnyin Jisọs, ke ini Enye edide. <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Ke ata akpanikọ, mbufo edi uku ye idara ñnyin!<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Eti Mbuk Emi Otode Timoti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Ke akpatre, ñnyin ikekemeke, ndiyọ aba. Ke ntre ñnyin ima ibiere ndika iso nditie ikpọñ ke Atens. <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />Kadaña emi ñnyin ikọdọñde Timoti, eyen ete ñnyin emi anamde utom ye ñnyin ọnọ Abasi ke edikwọrọ Eti Mbuk emi abañade Kraist, ñnyin ikọdọñ enye ndisọñọ mbufo idem, onyuñ anam mbuọtidem mbufo ọsọñada, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />man owo mbufo ndomo-kiet edifiak edem ke ntak mme ukọbọ emi. Mbufo ke idem mbufo emefiọk ete ke utọ ukọbọ emi edi ubak ke otu uduak Abasi ọnọ ñnyin. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Ke adaña emi ñnyin ikosuk idude ye mbufo, ñnyin ima ibabak itiñ inọ mbufo ite ke eyekọbọ ñnyin nte mbufo etimde efiọk, oro edi ukem ukem se iketibede emi.<verse eid="1TH 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Ntak edi oro ami ñkenyenede ndidọñ Timoti. Ñkekemeke ndiyọ aba, do ami mma ndọñ enye edifiọk ñkpọ abaña mbuọtidem mbufo. Ndik ama anam mi ñnyuñ ñkere nte ke usuñ kiet mme eken, Setan edidomo mbufo, ndien kpukpru ñwaidem ñnyin ewọrọ ikpuikpu. <verse eid="1TH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Ke emi Timoti ama okoto ñkañ mbufo afiak ebine ñnyin, enye ama ada eti mbuk emi abañade mbuọtidem ye ima mbufo ọsọk ñnyin. Enye etiñ ọnọ ñnyin nte mbufo ekerede nti ekikere ebaña ñnyin kpukpru ini, ñko ke mbufo emeyom ndikut ñnyin kpa nte ñnyin iyomde ndikut mbufo. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Ke ntem, ke kpukpru ukut ye mfina ñnyin, ñnyin imokop idọñesit kabaña mbufo, nditọ ete. Ekedi mbuọtidem mbufo ọkọnọ ñnyin isọñesit, <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />koro, idahaemi ñnyin imeneñede idu uwem, edieke mbufo esọñọde eda ke uwem mbufo ke Ọbọñ Jisọs.<verse eid="1TH 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Idahaemi ñnyin imekeme ndinọ Abasi ekọm mbaña mbufo. Ñnyin imọkọm Enye kabaña idara emi ñnyin inyenede ke iso Abasi ñnyin ke ntak mbufo. <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Ke okoneyo ye uwemeyo, ñnyin ibeñe Enye ke ofuri esit ñnyin ite Enye ayak ñnyin ikut mbufo iso ye iso man inọ mbufo se mbufo enanade ke mbuọtidem mbufo. <verse eid="1TH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Yak Abasi ñnyin ye Ete ke idem Esie, ye Ọbọñ ñnyin Jisọs, eberede usuñ ọnọ ñnyin ndidi mbine mbufo. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Yak Abasi anam ima mbufo ye kiet eken, ye kpukpru owo nde, akaka iso ndikọri tutu okpon ekesim akamba idaha emi ima ñnyin inyenede inọ mbufo adade. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Ke usuñ emi Enye eyenam esit mbufo ọsọñ ndien mbufo eyefọn ema enyuñ esana ke iso Abasi ye Ete ñnyin ke ini Ọbọñ ñnyin Jisọs edidide ye kpukpru mme mmọ emi enyenede Enye.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Duak Ndisana Ọyọhọ Ọyọhọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Ke akpatre, nditọ ete, mbufo ema ekpebe ñnyin nte mbufo ekemede ndidu uwem emi enemde Abasi esit. Emi edi usuñ emi mbufo ekade iso ndidu uwem. Ndien ke emi ñnyin imekpe mbufo ubọk inyuñ inyik mbufo, ke enyiñ Ọbọñ Jisọs, ite yak mbufo ekaka iso enam ekan. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Koro mbufo emefiọk mme item emi ñnyin ikọnọde mbufo emi okotode ke odudu Ọbọñ Jisọs. <verse eid="1TH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Emi edi uduak Abasi ọnọ mbufo. Enye oyom mbufo edi ndisana, enyuñ ewọrọ ofuri ofuri ekpọñ use. <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />Owo mbufo kiet kiet enyene ndifiọk nte enye ọdọde ñwan kiet ke edisana ye usuñ emi enyenede ukpono. <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />Idighe ke idiọk udọñ nte mme mmọ emi midiọñọke Abasi enamde.<verse eid="1TH 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />Ke ikọ emi ndien, owo baba kiet okudue eyen ete esie, mme ndituk eyen ete esie ke ndibọ enye ñwan esie. Ñnyin ima itetiñ emi inọ mbufo, ñnyin imoduri mbufo utọñ eti eti, ite Ọbọñ eyemia mme mmọ emi eduede uto ndudue emi ufen. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Abasi ikokotke ñnyin idi ididu uwem ke use, edi ke edisana ido uwem. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Ke ntre, owo kiet ekededi emi esinde ukpepñkpọ emi, isinke owo edi esin Abasi, emi ọnọde mbufo Edisana Spirit.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Ntak iduhọ ndiwet nnọ mbufo mbaña edinyene ima nnọ nditọ ete mbufo emi enimde Abasi ke akpanikọ. Abasi ama ekpekpep mbufo nte mbufo ekpenyenede ndima kiet eken. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Ndien mbufo emedodu utọ uwem ima emi kabaña kpukpru mme nditọ ete ke ofuri Masidonia. Ntem, ñnyin imekpe mbufo ubọk nditọ Ete, ite yak enanam ekan emi. <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Yak emi edi uduak mbufo ndidu ifure ifure uwem, nditiñ enyin nse mbubehe idem mbufo, ñnyuñ ññwana se edade edu uwem mbufo kpa nte iketiñde inọ mbufo ke ini emi ekebede. <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />Ke usuñ emi mbufo eyebọ ukpono eto mme mmọ emi minimke Abasi ke akpanikọ, idinyuñ inyeneke ntak ndidori enyin ke owo ke se idide unana mbufo.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nso Itibe Ke Andinim Ke Akpanikọ Akpade?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Nditọ ete, ñnyin iyom mbufo efiọk akpanikọ emi otukde mme mmọ emi ema ekekpaña, man mbufo edidu ke mfuhọ nte mme mmọ emi minyeneke idorenyin. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Ñnyin imenim ke akpanikọ ite ke Jisọs ama akpa, ama onyuñ eset ke ñkpa, ntre ñko ke ñnyin inim ke akpanikọ ite ke Abasi eyeda Jisọs edi ye mme mmọ emi ekenimde Enye ke akpanikọ ndien mmọ ekpa.<verse eid="1TH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Emi edi ukpepñkpọ Ọbọñ ke ñnyin itiñ inọ mbufo ite: ñnyin emi isuk idude uwem, ke usen emi Ọbọñ edidide, idibemke mme mmọ emi ekekpañade iso. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Ọkpọsọñ uyo edinyik eyedu, uyo Akwa Enjel, uyo obukpoñ Abasi, ndien Ọbọñ ke idem Esie ọyọsuhọrede oto ke enyọñ edi. Mme mmọ emi ekenimde Kraist ke akpanikọ ndien mmọ ekpa eyebem iso eset ke ñkpa. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Ndien ñnyin emi idude uwem ke ini oro eyetañ ñnyin kpukpru ye mmọ edọk ke enyọñ ndikosobo ye Ọbọñ ke ofum. Ndien, ntre ke ñnyin ididu ye Ọbọñ kpukpru ini. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Ke ntem, edọñ kiet eken esit eto ke mme ikọ emi.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Usen Ọbọñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Ntak iduhọ ndiwet mbufo nditọ ete mbaña ini ye ifet emi mme ñkpọ emi editibede. <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />Koro mbufo emefiọk ke idem mbufo nte ke usen Ọbọñ edidi nte inọ ke okoneyo. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Ke ini emi kpukpru owo edọhọde ete, “Kpukpru ñkpọ edobo, ifure onyuñ odu,” ke unana idorenyin, nsobo eyesim mmọ! Mmọ idibọhọke, editie nte ubiak emi esimde ñwan emi oyomde ndiman eyen.<verse eid="1TH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Edi mbufo nditọ Ete, iduhọ ke ekim, ndien usen oro inyeneke ndibabuat mbufo nte inọ. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Kpukpru mbufo edi mme mmọ emi edude ke uñwana enyuñ edude ke uyama usen. Ñnyin idighe mbio okoneyo mme mbio ekim. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Ke ntre, ikpanaha ñnyin ide idap nte mme mmọ eken, ñnyin inyene ndikpeme eyo ñnyuñ ndu ke mbeñeidem. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Edi ke okoneyo ke mme owo ede idap, edi ke okoneyo ke mme owo ekpa mmin. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Edi ñnyin idi mbon uñwaña usen, ndien inyene ndikpeme idem. Ñnyin inyene ndisine mbuọtidem ye ima nte mbọbọ ukwak ekọñ emi ebọpde ke ikpanesit, ndien idorenyin ubọhọ ñnyin nte itam ibuot.<verse eid="1TH 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Abasi ikemekke ñnyin ndibọ ukut iyaresit Esie, edi ndibọ edinyaña ñnyene emi otode ke Ọbọñ ñnyin Jisọs Kraist, <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />emi akakpade ọnọ ñnyin man otodo ñnyin idu uwem ọtọ kiet ye Enye, mme ñnyin idu ke uwem mme ikpakpa ke ini emi Enye edidide. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Ke ntak emi, edọñ kiet eken esit, enyuñ eñwam kiet eken, kpa nte mbufo ekade iso ndinam emi.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Nsio Ewuhọ Ye Editi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Ñnyin imekpe mbufo ubọk nditọ ete, nditiñ enyin nse mme mmọ emi enamde ọkpọsọñ utom ke otu mbufo, mme mmọ emi Ọbọñ ama ekemek ndida mbufo usuñ ñnyuñ ñkpep mbufo ñkpọ. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />Enam ñkpọ ye mmọ ye akamba ukpono ye ima, ke ntak utom emi mmọ enamde. Edu ke emem ke otu mbufo.<verse eid="1TH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Ñnyin imekpe ye mbufo nditọ ete: eduri mme mbio ifu utọñ, edọñ mbon esit ndik esit, eñwam mbio mmemidem, enyene ime ye kpukpru owo. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Ekut ete baba owo kiet isioho usiene idiọk ke idiọk, edi ke kpukpru ini yak edi uduak mbufo ndinam eti ñkpọ ye kiet eken, ye kpukpru owo nde. <verse eid="1TH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Edara kpukpru ini. <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />Ebọñ akam kpukpru ini. <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />Enyene esit ekọm ke kpukpru ifet; emi edi se idide uduak Abasi ọnọ uwem mbufo ke Kraist Jisọs.<verse eid="1TH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Ekubiọñọ Edisana Spirit. <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />Ekusin edisiak uduak Abasi ke ndek. <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />Edomo kpukpru ñkpọ ese: emum se ifọnde ekama. <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />Efara idem ke kpukpru oruk idiọkñkpọ. <verse eid="1TH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Yak Abasi emi ọnọde ñnyin emem anam mbufo esana ke kpukpru usuñ, onyuñ ekpeme ofuri idem, Spirit ukpọñ ye obukidem mbufo ke kpukpru ndudue ke ini edidi Ọbọñ ñnyin Jisọs Kraist. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Enye emi okokotde mbufo eyenam, koro Enye edide anam akpanikọ. <verse eid="1TH 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Ebọñ akam ñko ebaña ñnyin nditọ ete. <verse eid="1TH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Ekọm kpukpru nditọ ete ye ntim inua nditọ ete. <verse eid="1TH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Ami mekpe mbufo ubọk ke odudu ukara Ọbọñ ndikot ñwed emi nnọ kpukpru mme nditọ ete. <verse eid="1TH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Yak mfọn Ọbọñ ñnyin Jisọs Kraist odu ye mbufo.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>